1
00:00:00,161 --> 00:00:04,161
(Sheldon:)and solve the dark matter proton
decay problem at the same time.

2
00:00:05,600 --> 00:00:06,930
(Amy:)Fine.
How was your day?

3
00:00:06,935 --> 00:00:08,205
(Sheldon:)Oh, you said it.

4
00:00:10,772 --> 00:00:12,272
(Leonard:)Sheldon.

5
00:00:12,273 --> 00:00:13,773
(Amy:)Sheldon, I'm
worried about you.

6
00:00:13,775 --> 00:00:15,775
(Amy:)You're not eating,

7
00:00:15,777 --> 00:00:17,777
(Penny:)you haven't
slept in days,

8
00:00:17,779 --> 00:00:20,209
(Amy:)and, to be honest, that
cap is starting to smell.

9
00:00:21,616 --> 00:00:23,186
(Amy:)I know.

10
00:00:23,184 --> 00:00:25,854
