my principle source of anxiety.

11
00:00:31,292 --> 00:00:33,622
(Howard:)Okay, so it's one vote Emily,
one vote Cinnamon.

12
00:00:33,628 --> 00:00:35,558
(Howard:)Penny, you're
the tiebreaker.

13
00:00:38,700 --> 00:00:40,170
(Penny:)Say the quote again.

14
00:00:40,168 --> 00:00:44,238
"It's just so perfect
that we're both Libras."

15
00:00:49,644 --> 00:00:51,814
(Penny:)Wow, this is hard.

16
00:00:51,813 --> 00:00:52,813
(Penny:)I'm gonna say
Cinnamon.

17
00:00:52,814 --> 00:00:54,944
Yes!
Yes!
Come on!

18
00:00:56,317 --> 00:00:57,887
(Howard:)That was the last one,
I promise.

19
00:00:57,886 --> 00:00:59,216
We won't play anymore.

20
00:00:59,220 --> 00:01:00,850
(Sheldon:)Thank you.

